+S_n^{\mathcal P}(R)=\sup_{\rho\in\mathcal P_R}(\lambda_{n+1}(\rho)-\lambda_n(\rho)).
+\end{align*}
+$\mathcal P_R$ 不预设块数上限. 则
+\begin{equation}\label{eq:sup-limit}
